<title>USA: CCC to offer 7.8 million bushels wheat for sale.</title>
<headline>CCC to offer 7.8 million bushels wheat for sale.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1996-10-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Commodity Credit Corporation (CCC) of the U.S. Department of Agriculture will offer nearly 7,803,703 bushels of government-owned wheat for sale, the Kansas City CCC office said.</p>
<p>Offers and any modification or withdrawal of offers must be received in the Kansas City Commodity Office by 1430 CDT/1930 GMT on October 16, 1996 and awards will be made no later than October 17.</p>
<p>--Doris Frankel 312-983-7305</p>
